      "query": "select\nT2.XH as XH, --学号\nT2.XJH as XJH,--学籍号\nT2.YXBM as YXBM,--院系编码\nT2.YXMC as YXMC,--院系名称\nT2.ZYBM as ZYBM,--专业编码\nT2.ZYMC as ZYMC,--专业名称\nT2.ZYFXM as ZYFXM,--专业方向码\nT2.ZYFXMC as ZYFX,--专业方向名称\nT2.BJBM as BJBM,--班级编码\nT2.BJMC as BJMC,--班级名称\nT2.RXFS as RXFS,--入学方式\nT2.RXNY as RXNY,--入学年月\nT2.RXZF as RXZF,--入学总分\nT2.SSNJ as SSNJ,--所属年级\nT2.XZ as XZ,--学制\nT2.XXNX as XXNX,--学习年限\nT2.XKMLM as XKMLM,--学科门类码\nT2.HDXLFSM as HDXLFSM,--获得学历方式码\nT2.PYCCM as PYCCM,--培养层次码\nD10.DMMC as PYCC,--培养层次\nT2.PYFSM as PYFSM,--培养方式码\nD11.DMMC as PYFS,--培养方式\nT2.PYMSM as PYMSM,--培养模式码\nD12.DMMC as PYMS,--培养模式\nT2.WTPYDW as WTPYDW,--委托培养单位\nT2.WTPYDQ as WTPYDQ,--委拖培养地区\nT2.JDFSM as JDFSM,--就读方式码\nT2.XSLBM as XSLBM,--学生类别码\n--D13.DMMC as XSLB,--学生类别\nT2.XSLXM as XSLXM,--学生类型码\nD14.DMMC as XSLX,--学生类型\nT2.XXXSM as XXXSM,--学习形式码\nD15.DMMC as XXXS,--学习形式\nT2.WYLBDM as WYLBM,--外语类别码\nT2.WYSP as WYSP,--外语水平\nT2.YJBYRQ as YJBYRQ,--预计毕业日期\nT2.SJBYRQ as SJBYRQ,--实际毕业日期\nT2.SFZX as SFZX,--是否在校\nT2.XJZTM as XJZTM,--学籍状态码\nD16.DMMC as XJZT,--学籍状态\nT2.XSDQZTM as XSDQZTM,--学生当前状态码\nT2.FDYGH as FDYGH,--辅导员工号\nT2.DSGH as DSGH,--导师工号\nT2.ZKZH as ZKZH,--准考证号\nT2.KSH as KSH,--考生号\nT2.BDH as BDH,--报到号\nT2.KSLBM as KSLBM,--考生类别码\nD17.DMMC as KSLB,--考生类别\nT2.BYZX as BYZX,--毕业中学\nT2.ZSYXBM as ZSYXBM,--招生院系编码\nT2.ZSYXMC as ZSYXMC,--招生院系名称\nT2.ZSZYBM as ZSZYBM,--招生专业编码\nT2.ZSZYMC as ZSZYMC,--招生专业名称\nT2.ZSND as ZSND,--招生年度\nT2.ZSJD as ZSJD,--招生季度\nT2.ZSKLM as ZSKLM,--招生科类码\nD18.DMMC as ZSKL,--招生科类\nT2.ZSLBM as ZSLBM,--招生类别码\nT2.BYYXBM as BYYXBM,--毕业院系编码\nT2.BYYXMC as BYYXMC,--毕业院系名称\nT2.BYZYBM as BYZYBM,--毕业专业编码\nT2.BYZYMC as BYZYMC,--毕业专业名称\nT2.LQPC as LQPC,--录取批次\ntoString(now()) as TSTAMP\nFROM T_GXXS_BKSXJJBXX T2 \nleft join DM_XB_JW_PYCCM D10 on D10.DM = T2.PYCCM\nleft join DM_GB_PYFSM D11 on D11.DM = T2.PYFSM\nleft join DM_XB_JW_PYMSM D12 on D12.DM = T2.PYMSM\nleft join DM_XB_JW_XSLXM D14 on D14.DM = T2.XSLXM\nleft join DM_GB_XXXSM D15 on D15.DM = T2.XXXSM\nleft join DM_XB_JW_XJZTM D16 on D16.DM = T2.XJZTM\nleft join DM_XB_JW_KSLBM D17 on D17.DM = T2.KSLBM\nleft join DM_XB_JW_ZSKLM D18 on D18.DM = T2.ZSKLM",
